     "text": "But her pride doesn't stop at her family. It extends to her congressman, Mike Lawler, a two-term Republican running for reelection in New York's 17th district. It is one of the closest races in the country in a seat encompassing a string of commuter towns and suburbs around the Hudson River Valley.",
     "title": "Republican congressman tries to outrun a potential blue wave in New York toss-up seat",
